#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:764
msgid "We are vanquished, for I have been defeated!"
msgstr "Yenildik, çünkü ben mağlup oldum!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:765
msgid "This is the end! Without me, who will guide the prince?"
msgstr "Bu son! Bensiz, prensi kim yönlendirecek?"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:766
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:767
msgid "Fight on without me, friends! The Light shall always prevail!"
msgstr "Bensiz savaşmaya devam edin, dostlar! Işık her zaman galip gelecek!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:768
msgid "Ah’m not wounded! Jus’ need a moment... ta catch my breath..."
msgstr "Yaralı değilim! Sadece bir an... nefesimi toplamak için..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:769
msgid "Well, this is a new experience..."
msgstr "Pekala, bu yeni bir deneyim..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:770
msgid "Harper! No!"
msgstr "Harper! Hayır!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:770
msgid "Unngh... Sorry Baldras..."
msgstr "Öf... Üzgünüm Baldras..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:771
msgid "Ack! I tried my best..."
msgstr "Ah! Elimden gelenin en iyisini yaptım..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:771
msgid "Somf! No!"
msgstr "Somf! Hayır!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:772
msgid "Chantal! A dark shadow falls upon my soul..."
msgstr "Chantal! Ruhumun üzerine karanlık bir gölge düşüyor..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:772
msgid "—Oh!"
msgstr "—Ah!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:773
msgid "Dosh don’ feel so good..."
msgstr "Dosh kendini iyi hissetmiyor..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:774
msgid "Krawww..."
msgstr "Krawww..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:776
msgid "Send word of my fall to Sir Kaylan, Konrad! I fought my best..."
msgstr ""
"Düşüşümün haberini Sir Kaylan'a gönder, Konrad! Elimden gelenin en iyisini "
"yaptım..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:777
msgid ""
"Tell Sir Kaylan of my demise, Konrad... I have served you as best I could..."
msgstr ""
"Sir Kaylan'a ölümümü söyle, Konrad... Sana elimden geldiğince hizmet "
"ettim..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:778
msgid "Oh... I suppose I deserve this..."
msgstr "Ah... Sanırım bunu hak ettim..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:779
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Ah!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:780
msgid "Jotha regrets nothing..."
msgstr "Jotha hiçbir şeyden pişman değil..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:781
msgid "Bury me back home in the Dulatus..."
msgstr "Beni Dulatus'taki evime gömün..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:785
msgid "At least I die an honorable death..."
msgstr "En azından onurlu bir ölümle ölüyorum..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:787
msgid "Gah! At least I die a death worthy of the Horse Lords of old..."
msgstr "Kah! En azından eski At Lordları'na layık bir ölümle ölüyorum..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:788
msgid "Argh! I may fall, but the Clans shall always endure!"
msgstr "Argh! Düşebilirim, ama Klanlar her zaman var olacak!"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:789
msgid "Ack! Bury me under the Horse Plains..."
msgstr "Ah! Beni At Ovaları'nın altına gömün..."

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:790
msgid "Bah! Tell the Clans I died fighting..."
msgstr "Bah! Klanlara savaşarak öldüğümü söyleyin..."

#. [message]: speaker=Galdrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:798
msgid "I have met my match..."
msgstr "Eşimi buldum..."

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:804
msgid ""
"Tie him up and bind his wounds. The queen will want to make an example of "
"this one."
msgstr ""
"Onu bağlayın ve yaralarını sarın. Kraliçe bu adamdan bir ibret almak "
"isteyecektir."

#. [message]: speaker=Ethiliel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:814
msgid "I have given all in defense of my home..."
msgstr "Evim için her şeyimi verdim..."

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:820
msgid "Bind her arms and wings! The queen wants their leaders taken alive."
msgstr ""
"Kollarını ve kanatlarını bağlayın! Kraliçe liderlerinin canlı getirilmesini "
"istiyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:834
msgid ""
"Argh! I am nearly finished! But if I were to die here, my people would be "
"left leaderless."
msgstr ""
"Lanet olsun! Neredeyse bitiriyordum! Ama burada ölürsem, halkım lidersiz "
"kalır."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:838
msgid ""
"I have aided you in what ways I could, Konrad. Now I must leave your party, "
"and retreat eastwards to Lintanir Forest. May we someday meet again there."
msgstr ""
"Elimden geldiğince sana yardım ettim, Konrad.Şimdi grubundan ayrılmalı ve "
"doğuya, Lintanir Ormanı'na çekilmeliyim.Umarım bir gün orada tekrar "
"karşılaşırız."

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:856
msgid "I can’t believe it should end like this!"
msgstr "Bunun böyle bitmesine inanamıyorum!"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:870
msgid "At least I die alongside my princess..."
msgstr "En azından prensesimle birlikte ölürüm..."

